# Machine-owned simulator settings the companion passes through by NAME (SOLUSDEV-322 Q4).
# GZ_IP / IGN_IP / GAZEBO_IP pin the transport interface: on a multi-homed host the simulators
# advertise the first non-loopback address and local service calls time out (P9-T6).
# Never supplied by model/tool inputs. LD_LIBRARY_PATH is a recorded residual (SECURITY_REVIEW.md).
# A strict SUBSET of bin/launch's env -i list: SOLUS_MCP_WORKSPACE is companion-SET, never inherited.
SOLUS_GAZEBO_PATH
SOLUS_SIM_ROOTS
GZ_CONFIG_PATH
GZ_SIM_SYSTEM_PLUGIN_PATH
GZ_SIM_RESOURCE_PATH
GZ_PARTITION
GZ_IP
IGN_CONFIG_PATH
IGN_GAZEBO_SYSTEM_PLUGIN_PATH
IGN_GAZEBO_RESOURCE_PATH
IGN_PARTITION
IGN_IP
GAZEBO_MODEL_PATH
GAZEBO_PLUGIN_PATH
GAZEBO_RESOURCE_PATH
GAZEBO_MASTER_URI
GAZEBO_IP
LD_LIBRARY_PATH
